[lexical] Chore: Prefix the composition test selection callback

## Description

Rename the Safari composition regression's local slice callback to $slice and
update its two references. This satisfies rules-of-lexical without changing
any test setup, assertion, production source or native build input.

All eight business-source fingerprints and all 134 inputs of the recorded
14-case system-Pinyin/WKWebView capture still match. The captured manifests
remain historical originals; regression results and native evidence are reused.

